OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after motorcyclist
OL,4,Ahurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter a motorcyclist was seriously
OL,8,Finjured in a crash.
OL,10,FHumberside Police said the victim, a
OL,11,F43-year-old man, was riding a Kawasaki
OL,12,Fbike which collided with a Citroen DS3
OL,13,Fin Buckton, near Bridlington, East
OL,14,FYorkshire, at about 16:30 BST on 11
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FHe was taken to hospital with serious
OL,18,Finjuries.
OL,20,FAnyone with information or relevant
OL,21,Fdashcam footage is urged to contact
OL,22,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
